{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_027_02_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:13c83e2760bd2fd0f5c8bfd1c1f283bcc8e7298975ef132d665915093cdcd4e1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_d:cmd-000026:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1e7d88fcb683726c7d1d7c981689cdd0b72dcdf6cd5c406a21e872a5104c581",
      "text": "好了，今天里面装了什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19ae33da0b65f38f9b799b5b2e76343ca4320104e570d0807b26574c281f711d",
      "text": "今天是……香草茶吗。\n还附带了大家的留言呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c315e4a575591680e305c111192672d71f88daa7d1d842b2ef5e804acfc1db9",
      "text": "“早上好。昨晚睡得好吗？”\n“一同迈向砥砺钻研之岁月！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_d:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b44cb206e9faaf5240f3c3f404141e31747860fbea324fbb3b8a5b8d3edb9e6f",
      "text": "“今天想过成怎样的一天呢？”\n“要过成啪噼快乐的一天哦☆”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_d:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6cb7f7227e16650ae0c860de5879d7541309f1ac8a6829d29be37048e55e82f",
      "text": "“已经到周中了。稍微喘口气，继续加油吧”\n……这是●●●●プロデューサー写来的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_d:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1b80e5762b2a0af00fab2bd0609c182659084833cfada27b8254d6dc37bc678",
      "text": "昨天是巧克力，\n前天是糖果来着。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_d:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a236c8b0b6cd2915b68c76af1ea940b81c6b941e35cef59bdc120d61d3bc70c1",
      "text": "（每天早晨，随着一格格打开降临历，\n心情都会变得更加期待自己的生日）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_d:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dafe599054c2399b12e66dd40ff8ac39b80ec6a4e06e192d400a7dec8e518847",
      "text": "（这也是，多亏了大家啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_d:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb183fd56a47b514f29bcebf93cb114bd810c2d7b9c3eb4582132f0651ced7ec",
      "text": "好，喝完这杯香草茶，\n今天一天也要加油啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
